  <p id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head:m0000" ref="01w_vc9_b1s">孟陋</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head:m0004" ref="01w_vc9_b1s">少孤</persName>，武昌人也。吳司空<persName id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head:m0015" ref="edv_7cp_cl8">宗</persName>之曾孫也。兄<persName id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head:m0022" ref="gzc_9vs_o43">嘉</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-094-jin098-mengjia:head:m0024" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>征西長史。</p>
